                                            "Of, relating to, or partial to a sect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51d069f6-5721-4aea-96d4-3af493f8f1a7",
                                                "sense_id": "2933c50e-75be-35df-853c-6cd2b951b300",
                                                "text": "We were discussing solutions to the sectarian violence between Sunnis and Shias."
                                            }
                                        ]
